    "body": "Auto-prune inactive user accounts after a period of inactivity. The journal should be able to specify the period of inactivity, and the account into which the user should be merged. For example: if the journal enables this option, and sets the period of inactivity to 1 year, any user that hasn't logged in for 1 year should be merged into an admin account. \r\n\r\nThis should be an option for journals, set by default to \"off\", and similar to the auto-pruning of registered but not verified accounts (see \"require_validation\" and \"validation_timeout\" in config.inc.php). ",
